					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I really love the back and forth in this, giving us a window into the sort of disputes are bound to happen with in universe classifications and what not&#8230; They MUST as people are always arguing about it IRL so it follows that they would do so in the actual Foundation.</p> <p>But mostly I just like that there's an excuse for the wordplay concerning the naming or &quot;classification&quot; of this snake goddess.</p> <p>As always, ends on a terrific pay off one-liner</p> 
