					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13929941#post-4843428</guid>
				<title>The Make-A-Wish Foundation</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13929941/scp-5866#post-4843428</link>
