				<pubDate>Sun, 13 Dec 2020 03:21:45 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>HarryBlank</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6479803</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/claygolem" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7026247&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607843743" alt="claygolem" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7026247)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/claygolem" >claygolem</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607843743" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607843743" alt="Grigori Karpin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/grigori-karpin" >Grigori Karpin</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607843743" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span> for their crit!</p> <p>This was supposed to be titled &quot;The Namesake,&quot; but I just had to open my big mouth to Grigori and mention that I was tempted to call it &quot;The Namesnake,&quot; and then he wouldn't let me back off on it. If a pun passes Grigori's filter, I know it must be good.</p> <p>Neither Dr. Michael Nass, who is fictional, nor HarryBlank, which is a pseudonym, wrote the Wikipedia article on Tiamat. That was, however, actually a quote from it, which can be found (in the lede, amusingly enough) <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tiamat">here</a>.</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Image&nbsp;credits</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close&nbsp;image&nbsp;credits</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Tiamat.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/6281a8d3-6e76-45a6-b039-e7cbfeecd996">flickr</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Just Taken Pics<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY 2.0</p> <hr /> <p>Tiamat2.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tiamat.JPG">Wikimedia Commons</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Ben Pirard<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY-SA 3.0</p> <hr /> <p>Tiamat3.jpg is borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/c89aa20b-d88e-4ed4-9c96-263e0ec3adf0">flickr</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: W10002<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY-SA 2.0</p> <hr /> <p>Tiamat4.jpg is a composite. Its elements were borrowed from:</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/16ffa487-d601-4649-ab82-f1dfd968e954">cooperhewitt.org</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: Unknown<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC0&#160;1.0</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://ccsearch-dev.creativecommons.org/photos/05c84465-e548-4142-a29c-c0ed2c94af59">flickr</a><br /> <strong>Creator</strong>: ▓▒░ TORLEY ░▒▓<br /> <strong>License</strong>: CC BY-SA 2.0</p> <p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a